cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "AtpClient"
abstract: >-
  AtpClient is an Elixir client library for external automated theorem provers.
  It provides a uniform interface to multiple backends — SystemOnTPTP, StarExec,
  Isabelle, and locally installed TPTP-compliant binaries (LocalExec) — and
  normalises all results to standardised SZS status verdicts (e.g. :theorem,
  :satisfiable), enabling straightforward cross-prover comparison.
